&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxuslsyQOGHoiYb47TiA1n51Th&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustOiFVk8C3Uy4rotl5Nem5f&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q479dQIlZozY6cxcPNFuoY1rsxe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusq2WnfR822THsuqUosdSzFu&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IXRIdtDEyok4gexTp7tloeC8go1&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgdvDRDBF0MlFkDCwTIsL08f&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Operations Manager to own and continuously elevate the operational backbone of our institutional business — spanning Custody, Brokerage, FD Broker, CaaS, RBAC, KYC, Market Making programs, and Fees. &lt;br&gt;The role is centered around building durable operational frameworks and driving continuous process optimization across these business lines, converting disparate workflows into a coherent, instrumented, and scalable operating system. &lt;br&gt;You will combine deep operational fluency with data and AI-assisted tooling to surface gaps, codify methodologies, and compound incremental improvements into measurable operational leverage and revenue growth. &lt;br&gt;As a high-influence individual contributor with no direct reports, you will set the operational standard that the broader institutional team works to.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IXRIdtDEyok4gexTp7tloeC8go1&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgVRyNXxjC3HfVWDfVYWG4Me&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own and run daily operations across multiple institutional business lines — Custody, Brokerage, FD Broker, CaaS, RBAC, KYC, incentive programs, and Fees — managing internal stakeholders (RMs, sales, product, compliance, risk) and external institutional clients across email, Telegram, and internal messaging portals with SLA discipline.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg3hkT9JJEnScpFBDvO1AdTe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify operational gaps and growth opportunities using data analytics and AI-assisted workflows. Translate findings into concrete optimisation and automation initiatives with measurable impact on SLA, error rate, ticket volume, and client experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgB7DWoJ9UzR45ZU0VgiWnae&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design scalable operational frameworks for complex institutional scenarios: Client incentive program, fee tier and rebate administration, RBAC change requests, custody onboarding/withdrawal workflows, and cross-jurisdictional regulatory adherence (HK/SG/EU/US).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgOSyLgZP0OVhHie0wJu3tvg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive both incremental and strategic optimisation in parallel — Ship small ops improvements continuously while owning a longer-term ops roadmap that compounds operational leverage, retires manual toil, and unlocks revenue growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgNoVFe2aoHMteUj72LAjKSc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and deliver structured training for RMs and institutional clients on product mechanics, operational SOPs, and self-serve tooling. Act as the methodology owner whose playbooks the broader institution team adopts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
