&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate as an individual contributor with high influence — Able to align product, sales, compliance, and risk on operational changes without formal authority.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgJZlfspBDqCsO1jzTinqKCc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
