&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgufiZlrtNG3sOjMIceIcWFh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with Python or other scripting for ops automation, data wrangling, or workflow orchestration.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgb2JYohnQKWYPIN9wbyQiTx&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
