descriptions.job-1fuxemh:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AKmIdFMeNoZsMxxQTe5urisdsqf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AKmIdFMeNoZsMxxQTe5urisdsqf&quot;&gt;Digital Copywriter&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus1veglkNDsCbYMfa3pkDbKg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusyILJ9Gzprew5tVCuZBfyab&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world&#39;s largest cryptocurrency exchanges with over 80 million users and counting. With a vision to be the crypto ark of the world, we provide a comprehensive suite of products — Spot, Derivatives, Earn, TradFi, Alpha and more — to both retail and institutional clients. Ultimately, we endeavor to enable our users to achieve their dreams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus5Phj7u42N3LNkYaHzFshff&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxQ5sdsAin4OjJQBZHYsWne&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Copywriter/Senior Digital &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Copyw&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;riter &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing Copy and Translation team. We are more than writers, but skilled communicators, marketers and storytellers. With your mastery of prose and big picture thinking, you will weave seemingly disparate pieces of information and industry trends to form a cohesive narrative that fulfills our business objectives, inspires and engages our audience, and above all, driving home the message of our brand proposition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus39V1v2Dk6iiU1x9hN6P9Hf&quot;&gt;Key reponsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoLudCW55odFLLxjCkjuv0Nbsug&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Create clear and user-friendly content for Help Center articles and knowledge base entries, translating complex product logic into actionable guidance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bojcd91yooyP2UxsU8muhTGwsmd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Craft original campaign messaging that reflects our brand values and supports marketing objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IwymdJVU6o1qN5xgBtIuCC8yskh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Create engaging, persuasive copy across multiple channels, including websites, system communications, email campaigns, and UX/UI, in line with our editorial style guide and UI component guidelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkBJdx7dKocHULxvX1GuRy0xsgh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Edit and enhance existing content to ensure consistency with marketing strategy, tone, and positioning.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YgHCdb0YjoT6wXxRAUsuVyGvsec&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner closely with Product Managers and Project Managers to deliver clear, concise messaging for both everyday users and seasoned traders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qz6wdKBgso9JWFxBdYhuLeamsqb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with UX designers, marketers, and subject matter experts to ensure content is visually cohesive, on-brand, and aligned with intended outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NoNbd5zw3or2cixLyhUuJVGasyg&quot;&gt;Key requirements (updated)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrVcdzSZVorRgRxAbFGubQubsub&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3+ years of experience in copywriting, journalism, UX writing, or closely related content roles, with a Bachelor’s degree in Creative Writing, Journalism, Advertising, Marketing, English, or a related field.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A7w7duzVLo2XjAx3UNQuH031s1d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to Integrate AI Workflows in daily work to optimise work delivery performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U9w3d1p49onsLMxBjm0u3tNdsFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong technical writing skills, with the ability to produce clear, structured, and user-friendly content, especially for &lt;strong&gt;Help Center and knowledge base articles&lt;/strong&gt;, and to translate complex product logic into simple, actionable guidance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TQsXdL7JgoCjxfx45VJute19syh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chinese language proficiency is required, &lt;/strong&gt;including the ability to read and understand Chinese PRDs and communicate effectively with Chinese-speaking stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LsycdKfDhodlHSxOJKpuaNE1s7c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in cryptocurrency, fintech, or traditional finance is preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G5wUd42j8oTZNZxaAlWuBFpSstb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A product-oriented and flexible writer with a strong understanding of product workflows, logic, and the user journey, able to work closely with product teams, accurately interpret PRDs, and create effective user-facing content across multiple mediums (web, system communications, email campaigns, UX/UI).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRMbdCkdaobDncx2LN7ugEgHspb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment and deliver under tight timelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4hydhSFMoLDubxujPQuEGMSsxd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong project and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to prioritize tasks, manage multiple projects simultaneously, collaborate cross-functionally, handle feedback effectively, and maintain clarity and alignment in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IjGedF1TMomVtoxh8CcuOBogske&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams and stakeholders from diverse backgrounds.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-N2bhdgZhworrJIxod6XuycWls9d&quot;&gt;Good to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakPdyLQko7peexPUOmuDSQhsJf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
