&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuseysYUio6Qia64JLLAwE7dh&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;doxusokjWsaOkSCIjzixAfRM3sd&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusaUYeCmu82WSkkm5KDd00db&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JAF7dFJcWoUusRx7RKkuM14BsYc&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OqGZdUPi6oJlXzxlmNiu3gAmsVg&quot;&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Hong Kong, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tgw6d5xvpoJKoVx9eqBusbvzswb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;br&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;507&quot;&gt;The OKX Data Team owns and powers the company’s enterprise-wide data ecosystem. We are responsible for the full data lifecycle — from technology selection and architecture design to data ingestion, storage, ETL development, visualization, business intelligence, and advanced data science.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;779&quot;&gt;Our team drives end-to-end data ownership across OKX, ensuring that data is reliable, scalable, and actionable. We build the foundational data infrastructure that empowers evidence-based decision-making and continuously enhances the quality of our products and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;781&quot; data-end=&quot;944&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;lead a high-impact team&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;designing and scaling mission-critical data platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that serve the entire organization. You will also play a key role in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;driving the adoption of Agentic AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to elevate how we build, operate, and evolve our Data Engineering capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;Lead and mentor a team of Data Engineers to design and build resilient, scalable, and high-performance data pipelines for both batch and real-time streaming workloads&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Championing Agentic AI adoption across workflows (text-to-SQL agents, automated data quality remediation, self-healing pipelines etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Defining best practices, guardrails, and evaluation frameworks for safely deploying AI agents in the data lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and implement robust Data Warehouse and Data Mart solutions, including data modeling and ETL pipeline development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain analytics-ready Data Marts using best-practice dimensional modeling techniques (star and snowflake schemas)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement cloud-based data infrastructure using industry-standard technologies and modern architectural principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Drive technical excellence and delivery across mission-critical projects in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional teams to translate business requirements into scalable data solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;At least 8 of more years of experience in a Data Engineering, Data Warehousing or Data Mart related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Practical experience in building offline and real-time Data Warehouses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Data Warehouse Modelling theory and experience in Data Warehouse Model Design, plus an in-depth understanding of Data Warehouse systems, and experience supporting real-world business scenarios&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Agentic AI frameworks (LangChain, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, etc.) and productionising them in a data context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Experience building AI-powered data tools — NL query interfaces, automated anomaly remediation agents, intelligent data observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience applying Agentic AI to data engineering (text-to-SQL, LLM-powered remediation, self-healing pipelines, automated metadata/lineage management and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;36&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;Familiarity with various big data architectures, especially Alicloud DataWorks/MaxCompute, AWS Spark, Databricks, and StarRocks/Doris&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;38&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;Experience in R&amp;amp;D of real-time big data systems and real-time data warehouses&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building Data Platforms such as User Profiling, Risk Control Systems, and Indicator Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;38&quot;&gt;Prior experience managing a team of Software Engineers/Data Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusXHTxE1ng5NXSR8cKaY4vhf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusKanPRhZJXSlF12Rjx4mSnd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusiGTuvYAMpGUEPJUs2M7veh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
